                                                "sense_id": "710ff47c-9575-38f4-9b79-a445137c98c1",
                                                "text": "The agal he wore on his head gave him away as a Saudi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83e64eba-8c2e-4d3b-a8d2-9f1ad2fa96d2",
                                                "sense_id": "710ff47c-9575-38f4-9b79-a445137c98c1",
                                                "text": "It was in that moment I connected with what Saudis had been feeling in the months since Mohammed bin Salman or MBS, Saudi Arabia’s crown prince, stripped these morality guardians of their power."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
